[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0010","text":"──小火，盖上盖子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0020","text":"等三分钟再翻面哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0030","text":"三分钟啊——\n干等着有点久呢，对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0040","text":"呵呵，坐下来等吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0050","text":"阳希酱，之前\n跟我讲过那个出现松饼的绘本故事对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0060","text":"嗯……！小小的玩具士兵们\n把比自己大几十倍的松饼切开……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0070","text":"我也想变小了\n去突袭大松饼啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0080","text":"啊哈，要变小吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0090","text":"…………咦？\n是不是有什么奇怪的味道？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0100","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0110","text":"……确实\n像是有什么烧焦了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0112","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0120","text":"啊——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0130","text":"松饼……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0140","text":"啊～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0150","text":"一片漆黑……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0160","text":"这块松饼，焦掉的部分先道个歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0170","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0180","text":"材料还有剩……\n再挑战一次吧，羽那酱……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0190","text":"好！\n下次这三分钟，我们就在这儿等着吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_08080000_05_0200","text":"目标是做出让阳希酱想突袭的松饼──！"}]
